Here is the commit message:
OOZIE-2536 Hadoop's cleanup of local directory in uber mode
 causing failures (satishsaley via rohini)

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by Hadoop's cleanup process failing to handle the absence of the configuration file specified by `LauncherMapper.PROPAGATION_CONF_XML`, which is necessary for the proper functioning of the Oozie launcher in uber mode. Without this file, the cleanup process may attempt to delete or manipulate local directories incorrectly, leading to failures during job execution.

